Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.80,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,Hey... take a deep breath
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.80,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,with me for a {\c&H00F755A8&}second.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.80,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,Look, I know you've been carrying
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.80,0:00:08.20,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,something heavy {\c&H00F755A8&}lately.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.30,0:00:10.00,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,We all make {\c&H00F755A8&}mistakes.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.90,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,We all stumble and fall {\c&H00F755A8&}short.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.10,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,Remember this: your mistakes
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.50,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,will never be bigger than {\c&H00EB6325&}GOD{\c&H00FFFFFF&}'s {\c&H00F755A8&}grace.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.70,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,No matter what storm
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.70,0:00:20.90,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,you are walking through right {\c&H00F755A8&}now...{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.20,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00EB6325&}GOD{\c&H00FFFFFF&} is right beside {\c&H00F755A8&}you.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.50,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,He protects you, and will never let you {\c&H00F755A8&}go.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.60,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Eternally {\c&H00F755A8&}Grateful.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.50,KineticSub,,0,0,0,,You are not alone {\c&H00F755A8&}anymore.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.30,KineticCTA,,0,0,0,,Type AMEN in the comments,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.20,KineticCTA,,0,0,0,,and leave the names of your loved {\c&H00F755A8&}ones...{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.10,KineticCTA,,0,0,0,,Or share this with someone who needs
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.00,KineticCTA,,0,0,0,,a peaceful moment with {\c&H00EB6325&}GOD{\c&H00FFFFFF&} {\c&H00F755A8&}today.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
